## Web Crawler with Puppeteer
## >> IP Changer
## Only for Linux systems

Build:
    npm i -g yarn typescript && yarn && tsc

Test on local:
    node . --debug --test

Test on server:
    node . --debug --fast

Prod:
    node . --debug

"""
Flags:
    fast
    test
    debug: show messages to terminal
"""

# Usage
+ chmod +x ./bin/warp*
